   "text": "Pathway Taken by Water"
  },
  {
   "type": "bullets",
   "md": "- Osmosis causes water to pass into the **root hair cells**, through the **root cortex** and into the **xylem vessels**:\n- Once the water gets into the xylem, it is carried up to the leaves where it enters **mesophyll cells**\n- So the pathway is:"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "md": "**root hair cell → root cortex cells → xylem → leaf mesophyll cells**"
  },
